{"id":"n32795-1-14","stage":1,"title":"뉴스 · 新闻","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n32795-1-14-1","ko":"지수는 세상이 어떻게 돌아가는지도 잘 모르는 것 같아.","zh":"智秀好像连这个世界是怎么运转的都不太明白呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지수는","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"지수는","audio":"/audio/9ca6ce32d0646be4023e.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지수는","audio":"/audio/9ca6ce32d0646be4023e.mp3"}},{"text":"세상이","meaning":"世上，世间","explanation":"세상：世上，世间；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"세상","audio":"/audio/412ee72fe0ab7746e409.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62441","senseId":"2","lemma":"세상","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"세상이","audio":"/audio/dc683ab7fdd35f105322.mp3"}},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떻게","audio":"/audio/64e493d09f1b306ade0c.mp3"}},{"text":"돌아가는지도","meaning":"运转，运行","explanation":"돌아가다：运转，运行；는지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"돌아가다","audio":"/audio/1152d7a56fb1600a5774.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74103","senseId":"4","lemma":"돌아가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돌아가는지도","audio":"/audio/6d1086deedca4b27dc1f.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"很好地，了不起地","explanation":"잘：很好地，了不起地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"8","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"모르는","meaning":"不知道，不认识，不懂","explanation":"모르다：不知道，不认识，不懂；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"모르다","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29712","senseId":"1","lemma":"모르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모르는","audio":"/audio/5c899f629e78903f85b0.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같아","audio":"/audio/3eb21a4d72c48bbf26ae.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"412ee72fe0ab7746","term":"세상","zh":"世上，世间","audio":"/audio/412ee72fe0ab7746e409.mp3","entryId":"62441","definition":"人生活的整个社会。","pronunciation":["세ː상"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]},{"id":"1152d7a56fb1600a","term":"돌아가다","zh":"运转，运行","audio":"/audio/1152d7a56fb1600a5774.mp3","entryId":"74103","definition":"机能正常发挥。","pronunciation":["도라가다"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"很好地，了不起地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"非常好地、优秀地，值得称赞地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"20ef19694f337fd4","term":"모르다","zh":"不知道，不认识，不懂","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3","entryId":"29712","definition":"不清楚或不了解人或事物、事实等。","pronunciation":["모ː르다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/e8867165320ee149c59e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n32795-1-14-2